OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 2 JUN
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Arthur Bliss
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod with guest
OL,6,     Gbiographer Paul Spicer, delve
OL,7,     Ginto the period Bliss composed
OL,8,     Ghis Colour Symphony, and also met
OL,9,     Ghis future wife Trudy in America.
OL,10,G1700FIn Tune
OL,11,     GKatie Derham presents live music
OL,12,     Gand chat from pianist Stephen
OL,13,     GHough, ahead of his new album and
OL,14,     Gconcert in Oxford, and
OL,15,     Gaccordionist Ryan Corbett, who
OL,16,     Gwill be performing in Bath.
OL,17,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,18,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,19,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,20,     Gfavourites.
