OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 2 JUN
OL,4,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,5,     GAs part of Wigmore Hall's 125th
OL,6,     GAnniversary Festival, the
OL,7,     Gacclaimed Norwegian opera singer
OL,8,     GLise Davidsen joins performs
OL,9,     GLieder by Franz Schubert, with
OL,10,     Gpianist James Baillieu.
OL,11,G2145FThe Essay: The Other
OL,12,     FShostakoviches
OL,13,     GChris Addison explores the music
OL,14,     Gof Soviet regime favourite Georgy
OL,15,     GSviridov, whose melodious works
OL,16,     Goften led to his being dismissed
OL,17,     Gin the West - yet whose music
OL,18,     Gstill beguiles.
